{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36237","headline":"送陈秀才将游霅上便议北归 · 方干","name":"送陈秀才将游霅上便议北归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"婆娑恋酒山花尽，绕缭还家水路通。\n转檝拟从青草岸，吹帆犹是白苹风。\n淮边欲暝军鼙急，洛下先寒苑树空。\n诗句因余更孤峭，书题不合忘江东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}